{"version":3,"kind":"Article","sha256":"1250a2aa233c4f9d27f3e9d945b3ccb1f3f2b8cbe9f7b8f9a1c942431a16b882","slug":"seismology.seismic-wave","location":"/seismology/seismic-wave.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"地震波","content_includes_title":false,"license":{"content":{"id":"CC-BY-NC-4.0","url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/","name":"Creative Commons Attribution Non Commercial 4.0 International","CC":true}},"github":"https://github.com/seismo-learn/seismology101","numbering":{"title":{"offset":1}},"source_url":"https://github.com/seismo-learn/seismology101/blob/main/source/seismology/seismic-wave.md","edit_url":"https://github.com/seismo-learn/seismology101/edit/main/source/seismology/seismic-wave.md","thumbnail":"/seismology101/build/body-wave-propagatio-eeffe75f6ff3f622231a1ebc0c4a4ced.jpg","exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"seismic-wave.md","url":"/seismology101/build/seismic-wave-fbf74b36ac71985b8ff7ffca24b48dee.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"div","class":"page-meta","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"span","class":"page-meta-item","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✍️ 姚家园、田冬冬","key":"pboOzCUhGu"}],"key":"IhYkicqL9E"},{"type":"span","class":"page-meta-item","children":[{"type":"text","value":"📅 2022-11-12","key":"stsfy5eDxg"}],"key":"BPeDWQ2I5n"},{"type":"span","class":"page-meta-item","children":[{"type":"text","value":"⏱️ 20 分钟","key":"DevLeqVisH"}],"key":"ClMcwcBMVX"}],"key":"pzPH62u18d"}],"key":"HgtNbwycA8"},{"type":"thematicBreak","key":"RdCbmfyDls"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"震源激发的机械振动以地震波的形式在地球内部传播。地震波分为体波（body wave）\n和面波（surface wave）两种类型。体波是指在地球内部传播的波，而面波是指在地球表面\n附近传播的波。本节将介绍最基础的地震波理论。","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"key":"OqtGp7tbxw"}],"key":"FUGOYg2cnu"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":1},"end":{"line":14,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"体波","position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":1},"end":{"line":14,"column":1}},"key":"J3PboUAHV3"}],"identifier":"id","label":"体波","html_id":"id","implicit":true,"key":"Ikm8LoUeXZ"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"体波分为 P 波（P-wave）和 S 波（S-wave）两种。","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"key":"KQOJBo4PkK"}],"key":"GKbqCkThCQ"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":19,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"从传播速度的角度看，P 波比 S 波传播速度快。因而 P 波总是最先到达观测者所在的位置，\nS 波则在 P 波后到达。因而，P 波和 S 波也分别被称为 ","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"key":"htGE2umrMH"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"p","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"key":"gigWYycCJp"}],"key":"Qd0kAi5Rcs"},{"type":"text","value":"rimary wave 和 ","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"key":"mbNokZDB7E"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"s","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"key":"C8IHoa7QId"}],"key":"GgvlQksqn1"},{"type":"text","value":"econdary wave。","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"key":"sqvDYgIdeR"}],"key":"pRV5QVDp2U"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":25,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"从物理属性上来说，P 波是一种纵波（longitudinal wave），P 波在介质中传播时，介质的\n运动方向与波传播的方向相同或相反，介质交替压缩和膨胀导致介质的体积发生变化（如下图所示），\n因而 P 波也称为压缩波（com","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"key":"jrtRFH5h9z"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"p","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"key":"hMGZM6JLBn"}],"key":"vJyx6ZoK2y"},{"type":"text","value":"ressional wave）。S 波是一种横波（transverse wave），\nS 波在介质中传播时，介质的运动方向与波传播的方向垂直，会造成介质的剪切变形，但\n不改变介质的体积（如下图示），因而 S 波也称为剪切波（","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"key":"tdOi4XkxCs"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"s","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"key":"mx6H0kzFGd"}],"key":"mda7dh97nS"},{"type":"text","value":"hear wave）。","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"key":"CoYXNKP06i"}],"key":"Hsp0Kh2kyJ"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":29,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"事实上，地震学家首先根据波到达的先后顺序将两种波命名为 primary wave 和 secondary wave，\n并简称为 P-wave 和 S-wave，最后在进一步理解了两种地震波的物理属性后，才分别\n将其称为 com","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"key":"nCG1SwFdC3"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"p","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"key":"rCUNk6d3c7"}],"key":"iGdaAg2wFs"},{"type":"text","value":"ressional wave 和 ","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"key":"SXiS8OICw3"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"s","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"key":"NWbtV3BUAW"}],"key":"y8TZO2OR1D"},{"type":"text","value":"hear wave。","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"key":"lg0Iz1aeUF"}],"key":"bBRQ7CrOWF"},{"type":"container","kind":"figure","children":[{"type":"image","url":"/seismology101/build/body-wave-propagatio-eeffe75f6ff3f622231a1ebc0c4a4ced.jpg","alt":"\"体波的介质运动方向以及波传播方向\"","width":"80%","align":"center","key":"z15JuQWAk2","urlSource":"body-wave-propagation.jpg"},{"type":"caption","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1},"end":{"line":36,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"体波的介质运动方向以及波传播方向。引自《","position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1},"end":{"line":36,"column":1}},"key":"mw7TknC9c0"},{"type":"link","url":"https://www.cambridge.org/us/academic/subjects/earth-and-environmental-science/solid-earth-geophysics/introduction-seismology-3rd-edition?format=HB&isbn=9781316635742","position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1},"end":{"line":36,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Introduction to Seismology","position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1},"end":{"line":36,"column":1}},"key":"LOLUePB4kM"}],"urlSource":"https://www.cambridge.org/us/academic/subjects/earth-and-environmental-science/solid-earth-geophysics/introduction-seismology-3rd-edition?format=HB&isbn=9781316635742","key":"aK0VkUOCS6"},{"type":"text","value":"》（第三版）图 3.2。","position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1},"end":{"line":36,"column":1}},"key":"nw9vn3bBwo"}],"key":"jCdCiGkyqr"}],"key":"e5i2wyxbev"}],"enumerator":"1","key":"qwd1NsspO9"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":39,"column":1},"end":{"line":39,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"面波","position":{"start":{"line":39,"column":1},"end":{"line":39,"column":1}},"key":"KkvQI4M1Rt"}],"identifier":"id","label":"面波","html_id":"id-1","implicit":true,"key":"C6YBu779Ln"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":41,"column":1},"end":{"line":44,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"沿着地球表面附近传播的面波也有两种，即瑞利波（Rayleigh wave）和勒夫波（Love wave）。\nRayleigh 波在地表传播时，介质的运动既有与波传播方向相同或相反的分量，又有与波传播方向垂直\n的分量（如下图示）。Love 波在地表传播时，介质的运动方向与波传播方向垂直（如下图示）。\n面波的振幅随着深度增加会剧烈减少。","position":{"start":{"line":41,"column":1},"end":{"line":41,"column":1}},"key":"tDBNxvwWkK"}],"key":"g8QrwcgQ8J"},{"type":"container","kind":"figure","children":[{"type":"image","url":"/seismology101/build/surface-wave-propaga-b62b2122a4bbe3d86d145d3d02c5acd9.jpg","alt":"\"面波的介质运动方向以及波传播方向\"","width":"50%","align":"center","key":"Djrz0ui8bh","urlSource":"surface-wave-propagation.jpg"},{"type":"caption","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":51,"column":1},"end":{"line":52,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"基阶 Love 波（上）和 Rayleigh 波（下）的介质运动方向（假设面波沿着页面从左向右传播）。\n引自《","position":{"start":{"line":51,"column":1},"end":{"line":51,"column":1}},"key":"FbhNonfNKN"},{"type":"link","url":"https://www.cambridge.org/us/academic/subjects/earth-and-environmental-science/solid-earth-geophysics/introduction-seismology-3rd-edition?format=HB&isbn=9781316635742","position":{"start":{"line":51,"column":1},"end":{"line":51,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Introduction to Seismology","position":{"start":{"line":51,"column":1},"end":{"line":51,"column":1}},"key":"z9sAl6RvxU"}],"urlSource":"https://www.cambridge.org/us/academic/subjects/earth-and-environmental-science/solid-earth-geophysics/introduction-seismology-3rd-edition?format=HB&isbn=9781316635742","key":"DREL4GTR86"},{"type":"text","value":"》（第三版）图 8.5。","position":{"start":{"line":51,"column":1},"end":{"line":51,"column":1}},"key":"cWBFPjzQtP"}],"key":"PB1XyMEOkY"}],"key":"PJ0lM71aNf"}],"enumerator":"2","key":"anBP3qyQig"}],"key":"rJFgb8O8AK"}],"key":"NjxFOPuJO9"},"references":{"cite":{"order":[],"data":{}}},"footer":{"navigation":{"prev":{"title":"震源","url":"/seismology/seismic-source","group":"地震学基础"},"next":{"title":"地震震相","url":"/seismology/seismic-phase","group":"地震学基础"}}},"domain":"http://localhost:3000"}